            "notes": "If you haven't already, take a look at the playstyle notes at the top, even if only a quick glance at the headings between rounds. This build shines with a specific playstyle that might be unintuitive if you're not very familiar with Moira, or if you're used to playing her as a focused healer or an aggressive flanker.\n\n[Cross-Orbal](item_e567bb63-527f-4c72-8ba1-dc59be1a0dc1) will always be the first pick for this build.\n\nIn the first round, if you use your orbs reasonably well and make sure you're staying alive to use them, you can usually make more cash than anyone else. This can help you build up some momentum quickly as you'll usually be a top earner and be able to afford more powerful items earlier on.",
