            "notes": "[Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be) is a core item that you should always buy in round 2 and keep until the end of most matches.\n\n[Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) is a great choice to pair with it with your leftover cash.\n\nIf the enemy's been giving you grief from medium/long range (Ashe, Soldier, Cassidy, etc.), [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) is an underrated pick for the survivability it offers cheaply.",
