            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-09T18:10:47.114898+00:00",
            "notes": "Pick up [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) to pressure the enemy even more by applying healing reduction across their whole team more effectively than probably any other hero in Stadium.\n\nBecause you're sending out orbs so often, this should be up pretty often on the enemy team as-is. Because of that, I go with [Precarious Potency](item_b1305ee6-3027-4131-8797-dcbeb68e3953) as the third power in most games, to help keep your team's health topped-up more easily. But if you feel like you need the healing suppression to be up more consistently, or you're still getting the hang of aiming your orbs to keep them on the enemy most of the time, getting [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560) now is an option.",
